OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CSaturday:FA bright start, but any
OL,6,Fsunny spells will be short lived, as
OL,7,Fcloud increases from the north.
OL,8,FOutbreaks of rain arriving across
OL,9,Fduring the afternoon with some heavier
OL,10,Fbursts.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FDry
OL,13,Fwith variable amounts of cloud around
OL,14,Fon Sunday before another area of rain
OL,15,Farrives from the west for Monday.
OL,16,FTurning rather showery on Tuesday,
OL,17,Fwith a risk of thunder.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
